{
  "$schema": "../schema.json",
  "name": "com.andrechek.room-planner/room-planner",
  "title": "Room Planner",
  "category": "Other",
  "description": "Lay out a room to scale, check furniture, doors and clearances, and get a link to edit the plan.",
  "repository": "https://github.com/EricAndrechek/Room-Planner",
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "create_plan",
      "description": "Use when the user wants to lay out, furnish, fit furniture into, or get a floor plan of a room or home: returns a checked plan, a drawing, and an editable Room Planner link. One room or a whole floor (rooms joined by doors), any outline, round and L-shaped pieces.\nReturns {plan, issues, summary, url, editable}: the plan normalised in its unit, every layout issue (as check_layout), a summary, the link. `url` opens the plan in the Room Planner editor; it encodes the whole plan, so only a complete link works. Issues list overlaps, blocked doors and swings and pieces outside rooms (errors, warnings) and tight gaps (info); message positions are piece centres.\nPlan format (version 4): {version:4, name, unit, rooms, items}. Every length is in unit (use the user's). One floor coordinate system: x grows right, y grows DOWN; the floor's top-left corner at {x:0,y:0}.\n- Room outline: interior corners, clockwise. A W x D rectangle at (X,Y) is [{x:X,y:Y},{x:X+W,y:Y},{x:X+W,y:Y+D},{x:X,y:Y+D}], walls 0 top, 1 right, 2 bottom, 3 left; wall i runs from outline[i] to outline[i+1].\n- Opening offset runs clockwise from the wall's start corner to the opening's near edge (RIGHT TO LEFT on a bottom wall, BOTTOM TO TOP on a left wall), or from the end named by from (\"left\"/\"right\"/\"top\"/\"bottom\" as seen on the plan, or \"end\"): a door 2 ft from the bottom of the right wall is {wall:1, offset:2, from:\"bottom\"}.\n- Item placement {x, y, rotation} is the CENTRE of the piece, rotation clockwise degrees; width runs along x and depth along y before rotation. No placement: set aside (kept, off the floor).",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "plan": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "version": {
                "type": "number",
                "const": 4,
                "description": "Always 4."
              },
              "name": {
                "default": "Untitled",
                "description": "Plan name.",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 100
              },
              "unit": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "ft",
                  "in",
                  "m",
                  "cm"
                ],
                "description": "Unit of every length."
              },
              "rooms": {
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 50,
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,40}$",
                      "description": "Unique in the plan."
                    },
                    "name": {
                      "description": "E.g. \"Bedroom\".",
                      "type": "string",
                      "maxLength": 80
                    },
                    "outline": {
                      "minItems": 3,
                      "maxItems": 64,
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "x": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": -100000,
                            "maximum": 100000,
                            "description": "Floor x (grows right)."
                          },
                          "y": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": -100000,
                            "maximum": 100000,
                            "description": "Floor y (grows DOWN)."
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "x",
                          "y"
                        ]
                      },
                      "description": "Interior corners, clockwise. Rectangle from top-left: walls 0 top, 1 right, 2 bottom, 3 left."
                    },
                    "openings": {
                      "default": [],
                      "description": "Doors and windows.",
                      "maxItems": 64,
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,40}$",
                            "description": "Unique in the plan."
                          },
                          "kind": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "door",
                              "window"
                            ],
                            "description": "Door or window."
                          },
                          "wall": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "maximum": 9007199254740991,
                            "description": "Wall i runs from outline[i] to outline[i+1]."
                          },
                          "offset": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "description": "From the wall's start corner to the opening's near edge."
                          },
                          "width": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
                            "maximum": 10000,
                            "description": "Width along the wall."
                          },
                          "from": {
                            "description": "Input only: the end offset is measured from. Default \"start\".",
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "start",
                              "end",
                              "left",
                              "right",
                              "top",
                              "bottom"
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "default": "swing-in",
                            "description": "Doors only. \"swing-in\": into the room that lists it.",
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "swing-in",
                              "swing-out",
                              "double-in",
                              "double-out",
                              "sliding",
                              "pocket",
                              "bifold",
                              "opening"
                            ]
                          },
                          "hinge": {
                            "default": "start",
                            "description": "Doors only. \"start\": on the left, from inside facing the wall.",
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "start",
                              "end"
                            ]
                          },
                          "swingAngle": {
                            "description": "Doors only: how far it opens, degrees.",
                            "anyOf": [
                              {
                                "type": "number",
                                "const": 90
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "number",
                                "const": 180
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "id",
                          "kind",
                          "wall",
                          "offset",
                          "width"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": {}
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "outline"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": {}
                },
                "description": "One floor: rooms touch to share a wall, never overlap."
              },
              "items": {
                "default": [],
                "description": "Furniture.",
                "maxItems": 500,
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,40}$",
